{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sketchy Arcade</i> is a 3D virtual arcade where you play mini games, compete for high scores, win prizes, and customize your living space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore the arcade, you'll find games like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mini golf</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro space shooters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roguelike platformers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Racing games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First person shooters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playing games earns you tickets which can be exchanged for toys, collectibles, decorations, and character customizations. The more you play, the more you unlock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sketchy Arcade</i> is best experienced alongside the YouTube channel <i>Sketchy Games,</i> where you can follow along with the game's development and progress.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683510?t=1752290731","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683510/0bb177b956b57f54db968bb9d8b242e2cdea49d4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752290731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683510/e96df7371704aed2f237ddb16e75911f1f46bfad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752290731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683510/e96df7371704aed2f237ddb16e75911f1f46bfad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752290731","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sketchy Arcade</i> is a 3D virtual arcade where you play mini games, compete for high scores, win prizes, and custo